{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T05:32:02.508Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"350ed4389a56f33a46d82a379768e199b49d63da2a0af13bee438335923f9cc0","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests show. The latest digest is 9/30, so \"today\" means as of that one.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day. Digests from 2025-07 onward already call it \"Gideon's fleet account\", so that line may only mean he took over day-to-day handling. The Vantorre Group date is firm. I'd double-check the Mobility wording before it goes on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, though the digests never name the account outright. Moss writes \"Gideon's medical account\" in the 12/1/2025 and 9/30/2026 digests. In March 2025 it was \"Nadia's medical account\". I don't see a handoff date for that move.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't tell you. The digests only call it the pod's \"outdoor\" or \"retail\" account and never name an owner. Nadia is hosting a training session for them, but that doesn't make her the owner. You'll want to confirm this one with the pod or the CRM.\n\n**Vantorre Group change of hands: 2026-05-04.** Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\". The 5/4 digest says it was \"effective 2026-05-04\", and that Mateo Quiroga was told at 08:30 about the new contact."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
